; ESH-0101 / SW-81 hard gate: the default native stack must fail loudly, while
; ESHKOL_STACK_SIZE=1G must complete this same source at 2000000 frames.
;
; Plain non-tail user recursion past ~270k frames used to die with SIGILL and
; no diagnostic. The runtime depth guard only covered selected helper paths;
; the native stack guard now watches every generated user-function prologue.
;
; Measured 2026-07-02 (master 2692ca63, macOS arm64):
;   depth 260000 -> OK (JIT and AOT)
;   depth 270000 -> SIGILL rc 132, no output (JIT)
; The gate is scripts/run_stack_overflow_diagnostic.sh. It runs JIT and AOT
; under a generous inherited `ulimit -s 1048576` (the initial Linux stack
; extent is fixed at exec time): unset ESHKOL_STACK_SIZE must print
; `eshkol: stack overflow: recursion depth exceeded the N MiB stack
; (ESHKOL_STACK_SIZE)` and exit nonzero; ESHKOL_STACK_SIZE=1G must print
; `OK 2000000` and exit zero. It also repeats the diagnostic/completion pair
; through parallel-map workers using ESHKOL_WORKER_STACK_BYTES.
(define (down n)
  (if (= n 0) 0 (+ 1 (down (- n 1)))))
(display "OK ") (display (down 2000000)) (newline)
